# =============================================================================
#  ASM.orch - Audio Scene Management
#  Workflow Description Language v0.3, AIF V3.0
#
#  One Controller, one Module, which runs continuously: Text and Speech
#  Translation feeds back into Speech Object Editing, so the Module is not run an
#  exchange at a time. The User Agent binds devices to its boundary for the life of
#  the workflow, each to one Port, by Data Type and Port Number:
#
#    what the User gives the Module -
#      ObjectCommand, SceneCommand   the commands of the editing of an Object and of
#                                    the Scene; SceneIn the Audio Scene
#                                    (the Module takes no Audio Object at its boundary: the
#                                    Reference Model of 2026-10-26 has none; an Object enters as
#                                    the member of a Scene, or is made by a command)
#
#    what the Module gives the User -
#      ObjectOut, Scene, ObjectReport, the Audio Object and the Audio Scene as edited, and
#      SceneReport                   the responses saying how each command was executed
#      Unused                        what the User Agent has no use for
#
#  No Port of the Module has a Basic Data Type: an Audio Object holding one Basic Audio
#  Object is that Object.
#
#  Where the Module keeps the Objects and the Scenes is the Controller's (its configuration):
#  the User Agent names no place, and no AIM.
# =============================================================================

workflow ASM over 1CAE-ASM-V1.0-I01

on Start:

    ask Controller to start

    stream  ObjectCommand  (CAE-UCM-V1.0:1) from device "ObjectCommand"
    stream  SceneIn        (OSD-ASD-V1.5:1) from device "SceneIn"
    stream  SceneCommand   (CAE-UCM-V1.0:2) from device "SceneCommand"

    deliver ObjectOut      (OSD-AUO-V1.5)   to device "ObjectOut"
    deliver ObjectReport   (CAE-UCM-V1.0:1) to device "ObjectReport"
    deliver Scene          (OSD-ASD-V1.5)   to device "Scene"
    deliver SceneReport    (CAE-UCM-V1.0:2) to device "SceneReport"
    deliver SpeechOut      (OSD-SPO-V1.5:1) to device "Unused"
    deliver SpeechSceneOut (OSD-SSD-V1.5)   to device "Unused"
    deliver MultimodalOut  (OSD-MSD-V1.5)   to device "Unused"
    deliver SpeechReport   (CAE-UCM-V1.0:3) to device "Unused"
    deliver SpeechSceneRep (CAE-UCM-V1.0:4) to device "Unused"
    deliver MultimodalRep  (CAE-UCM-V1.0:5) to device "Unused"

    loop until Stop:
        wait 1s

on Stop:
    ask Controller to stop
